<title>RUSSIA: Russian Central Bank denies gold-backed bonds talk.</title>
<headline>Russian Central Bank denies gold-backed bonds talk.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A senior Russian Central Bank official on Tuesday denied market talk that its representatives would meet Japanese trading houses in Tokyo this week to discuss the possibility of using gold to back bonds issued by the Russian government.</p>
<p>&quot;The Central Bank is not holding any such talks,&quot; said Central Bank First Deputy Chairman Sergei Aleksashenko, when asked if such talks had taken place or would take place.</p>
</text>
